g to carry alone since February, and it's been quietly confirming itself ever since: nothing done, so the verdict holds, so nothing gets done. That loop doesn't need an exam to run.\n\nCan I ask — is there anyone who knows about February? Not the department, not the exam. Someone who knows that's what happened.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"February, and not about the exam — about everything. The painting and the study both stopped, and the verdict covered both.\n\nThat's a big thing to carry alone since February, and it's been quietly confirming itself ever since: nothing done, so the verdict holds, so nothing gets done. That loop doesn't need an exam to run.\n\nCan I ask — is there anyone who knows about February? Not the department, not the exam. Someone who knows that's what happened.","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":4653,"promptTokens":1634,"completionTokens":277,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:15:45"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":55,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"4f26f3ca8f7c401c801417e1a6d9e52e","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0017006933872826693,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b03f6316438f403db4d199c","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795421745106,"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:15:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f6316438f403db4d199c","chatId":"85aaaa5d14ac42609b4c1a84ac381238","sessionId":null,"userId":130582,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"It was in February. Not about the exam, about everything. That the painting was finished and the study was finished and the version of me that did those things didn't make it, and everyone was going to find out eventually\n\nAnd then it's been true every week since, because I haven't done anything","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":54,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"4f26f3ca8f7c401c801417e1a6d9e52e","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0017006933872826693,"emotions":[{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":8,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":8,"sort":9},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":7,"sort":6},{"code":"happy","name":"快乐","value":0,"sort":1},{"code":"expect","name":"期待","value":0,"sort":2},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":0,"sort":3},{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":0,"sort":4},{"code":"surprised","name":"惊讶","value":0,"sort":5},{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":0,"sort":7}],"relationId":"6b03f6316438f403db4d199d","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795421745103,"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:15:45","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f6286438f403db4d1996","chatId":"85aaaa5d14ac42609b4c1a84ac381238","sessionId":null,"userId":130582,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"So the ending was decided months ago, before the exam — and the thing you can't stand is the idea of other people arriving at the same verdict independently. That would make it not a fear but a fact.\n\nBut a verdict reached months ago, before there was any evidence, isn't a prediction. It's a decision. What was the ending you decided?","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"So the ending was decided months ago, before the exam — and the thing you can't stand is the idea of other people arriving at the same verdict independently. That would make it not a fear but a fact.\n\nBut a verdict reached months ago, before there was any evidence, isn't a prediction. It's a decision. What was the ending you decided?","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":5889,"promptTokens":1622,"completionTokens":239,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:15:36"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":53,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"9a29180440d4417e9d485c4c8e0d5f98","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.02033154049759537,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b03f6286438f403db4d1995","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795421736805,"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:15:36","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f6286438f403db4d1995","chatId":"85aaaa5d14ac42609b4c1a84ac381238","sessionId":null,"userId":130582,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"The second one. If they're being careful with me they've already decided how it goes, and it's the same ending I decided months ago\n\nExcept they'd be right about it, which is the part I can't stand","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":52,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":null,"isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.02033154049759537,"emotions":[{"code":"anger","name":"愤怒","value":6,"sort":7},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":6,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":6,"sort":9},{"code":"calm","nam