so means ungraded. Both are true at once, and no amount of thinking resolves it.\n\nThe only thing that breaks a loop like that is one instance of it. One Wednesday, twenty minutes of lunch spent with the book open, nobody told. Not to prove it counts — just to find out what it actually feels like when no one's grading and no one's holding it up.","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":12331,"promptTokens":1406,"completionTokens":305,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:14:24"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":41,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":"893d13ecfa4b4b7c88f4d23a61f69c80","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.148040305941214,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6b03f5e06438f403db4d194e","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1795421664998,"createTime":"2026-11-23 16:14:24","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6b03f5e06438f403db4d194e","chatId":"85aaaa5d14ac42609b4c1a84ac381238","sessionId":null,"userId":130582,"orgId":3721,"botId":1032,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"Both? If nobody sees it then it doesn't count. But nobody seeing it also means nobody's grading me\n\nI feel like I'm going in circles on this","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":40,"responseSource":"agent:llm","promptTraceId":null,"isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.148040305941214,"emotions":[{"code":"calm","name":"平静","value":3,"sort":4},{"code":"sadness","name":"悲伤","value":3,"sort":8},{"code":"dislike","name":"厌恶","value":3,"sort":9},{"code":"trust","name":"信任","value":2,"sort":3},{"code":"fear","name":"恐惧","value":2,"sort":6},{"code":"expect","nam